  "details": "1. I claimed the starter bundle on my 5 year old steam account but NOT my 7 year old vrchat account\n\n2. I merged my steam account with my vrchat account. Since then, i now see a red dot on my inventory button and another starter bundle inside.\n\n3. I attempted to claim the starter bundle and I was met with a popup that reads: \"Error Unable to claim bundle.\"\n\nexpected behaviour: no starter bundle should be present at all because I claimed the bundle previously on my steam account.\n\nI am unable to get rid of the red dot on my inventory button.",
